<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>わり算の筆算マスター</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #f0f9ff; color: #333; }
        .card { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; max-width: 400px; margin: 0 auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        h1 { color: #0284c7; font-size: 20px; }
        .problem { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; color: #1e293b; }
        button { background: #0284c7; color: white; border: none; padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 18px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; }
        .ans { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 24px; color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card">
        <h1>わり算の筆算マスター</h1>
        <p>問題：</p>
        <div class="problem">72 ÷ 3 = ?</div>
        <button onclick="document.getElementById('ans').innerText = '正解：24'">答えを見る</button>
        <div class="ans" id="ans"></div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
